<title>JAPAN: Toshiba Ceramics extends gains to hit 1997 high.</title>
<headline>Toshiba Ceramics extends gains to hit 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Toshiba Ceramics Co Ltd extended recent gains in Tokyo morning trading to hit a high for this calendar year, brokers said.</p>
<p>At midday, the shares were up 130 yen at 1,310, a high for this calendar year, in heavy volume. The company was the second biggest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
